            "review_title": "Review at Rus Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Le Noir\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nSecret but not...!\nDec 2024 • Solo\nHidden gem, good \" homemade\" food in town at an excellent price value. Cozy house with friendly services from the staffs . All mixed with the best country music in Thao Dien. Other small details that its really quiet and good place to be alone or escape busy things.\nWritten October 11, 2025",
